      <p class="mt-2 text-[#a9b1d6]">Key areas where I excel and create impact</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid" data-controller="entrance" data-entrance-delay-value="200">
      <div class="dev-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">System Architecture</h3>
        <p class="card-content">
          Designing scalable, maintainable systems with a focus on high-level abstractions and clean interfaces.
          Experienced in microservices, API design, and complex system integration.
        </p>
        <div class="skills-container">
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-sitemap"></i>
            System Design
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i>
            Microservices
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-project-diagram"></i>
            API Design
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">Technical Leadership</h3>
        <p class="card-content">
          Leading engineering teams with a focus on mentorship, knowledge sharing, and building high-performing cultures.
          Strong emphasis on code quality and best practices.
        </p>
        <div class="skills-container">
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
            Team Leadership
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
            Mentoring
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-code"></i>
            Best Practices
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dev-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">Cloud & DevOps</h3>
        <p class="card-content">
          Implementing robust CI/CD pipelines and cloud infrastructure with a focus on security, scalability, and automation.
        </p>
        <div class="skills-container">
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-cloud"></i>
            Cloud Architecture
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-infinity"></i>
            CI/CD
          </span>
          <span class="skill-pill">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
            Security
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

